window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-094.json",{"day":94,"title":"Reading History in a Coastal Terminal","targetWords":[{"word":"territory","gloss":"地域","context":"Its tower had once defended a frontier, but the surrounding territory was now a busy metropolitan district.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"province","gloss":"省","context":"A guide explained that ships had linked the province to distant markets long before modern highways existed.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"tower","gloss":"高塔","context":"Its tower had once defended a frontier, but the surrounding territory was now a busy metropolitan district.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"amid","gloss":"在其间","context":"The interior was cool even amid summer heat.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"pole","gloss":"旗杆","context":"The route crossed a yard and passed through a gate beside a flag pole.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"gate","gloss":"门","context":"The route crossed a yard and passed through a gate beside a flag pole.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"underground","gloss":"地下","context":"Inside, an underground corridor reached a storage chamber beneath the main hall.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"upward","gloss":"向上","context":"A staircase led upward to a lookout and then downward into a restored workshop.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"interior","gloss":"内部","context":"The interior was cool even amid summer heat.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"outlet","gloss":"出口","context":"A small hole admitted daylight, while a separate outlet allowed smoke to escape.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"nowhere","gloss":"无处","context":"History was nowhere completely separate from contemporary life.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"outer","gloss":"外面的","context":"Altitude offered military advantage: from the outer wall, guards could observe the water and signal danger.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"alongside","gloss":"在旁边","context":"A glass skyscraper stood alongside the stone monument, and the avenue below led downtown to a former palace.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"downtown","gloss":"市中心","context":"A glass skyscraper stood alongside the stone monument, and the avenue below led downtown to a former palace.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"palace","gloss":"宫殿","context":"A glass skyscraper stood alongside the stone monument, and the avenue below led downtown to a former palace.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"setting","gloss":"环境","context":"The county museum wanted to explain how this changing setting connected trade, power, and ordinary movement.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"beside","gloss":"在…旁边","context":"The route crossed a yard and passed through a gate beside a flag pole.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"frontier","gloss":"边境","context":"Its tower had once defended a frontier, but the surrounding territory was now a busy metropolitan district.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"yard","gloss":"院子","context":"The route crossed a yard and passed through a gate beside a flag pole.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"altitude","gloss":"高度","context":"Altitude offered military advantage: from the outer wall, guards could observe the water and signal danger.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"backward","gloss":"向后的","context":"The guide warned visitors not to step backward near the verge of an uneven landing.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"hole","gloss":"洞","context":"A small hole admitted daylight, while a separate outlet allowed smoke to escape.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"ward","gloss":"病房","context":"Visitors walked down an aisle between exhibits and learned that a former hospital ward had occupied part of the building.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"castle","gloss":"城堡","context":"Travelers arriving aboard a ferry rarely noticed the old castle above the terminal.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"county","gloss":"郡","context":"The county museum wanted to explain how this changing setting connected trade, power, and ordinary movement.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"avenue","gloss":"大街","context":"A glass skyscraper stood alongside the stone monument, and the avenue below led downtown to a former palace.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"exit","gloss":"出口","context":"Rather than treat the past as a separate realm, it designed a walking tour that began where passengers actually arrived, in the midst of luggage, announcements, and people looking for the exit.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"threshold","gloss":"门槛","context":"People entering the castle crossed a threshold where their right to remain was examined.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"monument","gloss":"历史建筑","context":"A glass skyscraper stood alongside the stone monument, and the avenue below led downtown to a former palace.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"metropolitan","gloss":"大都市的","context":"Its tower had once defended a frontier, but the surrounding territory was now a busy metropolitan district.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"skyscraper","gloss":"摩天大楼","context":"A glass skyscraper stood alongside the stone monument, and the avenue below led downtown to a former palace.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"chamber","gloss":"室","context":"Inside, an underground corridor reached a storage chamber beneath the main hall.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"downward","gloss":"向下","context":"A staircase led upward to a lookout and then downward into a restored workshop.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"corridor","gloss":"走廊","context":"Inside, an underground corridor reached a storage chamber beneath the main hall.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"domain","gloss":"管辖范围","context":"The castle's political domain had disappeared, but its walls still influenced roads and property lines.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"realm","gloss":"领域","context":"Rather than treat the past as a separate realm, it designed a walking tour that began where passengers actually arrived, in the midst of luggage, announcements, and people looking for the exit.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"upright","gloss":"直立的","context":"One exhibit showed workers keeping heavy frames upright; another traced an old drain outward toward the river.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"aboard","gloss":"在船上","context":"Travelers arriving aboard a ferry rarely noticed the old castle above the terminal.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"midst","gloss":"中间","context":"Rather than treat the past as a separate realm, it designed a walking tour that began where passengers actually arrived, in the midst of luggage, announcements, and people looking for the exit.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"outward","gloss":"向外的","context":"One exhibit showed workers keeping heavy frames upright; another traced an old drain outward toward the river.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"terminal","gloss":"航站楼","context":"Travelers arriving aboard a ferry rarely noticed the old castle above the terminal.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"vertical","gloss":"垂直的","context":"Its high dome created an impressive vertical space, but magnificence did not guarantee comfort.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"dome","gloss":"圆屋顶","context":"Its high dome created an impressive vertical space, but magnificence did not guarantee comfort.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"southeast","gloss":"东南","context":"From there, visitors could look southeast toward the mainland or northeast across the harbor.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"aisle","gloss":"通道","context":"Visitors walked down an aisle between exhibits and learned that a former hospital ward had occupied part of the building.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"mainland","gloss":"大陆","context":"From there, visitors could look southeast toward the mainland or northeast across the harbor.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"northeast","gloss":"东北","context":"From there, visitors could look southeast toward the mainland or northeast across the harbor.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"verge","gloss":"边缘","context":"The guide warned visitors not to step backward near the verge of an uneven landing.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"overhead","gloss":"在头顶上","context":"Patients could hear footsteps overhead and feel moisture rising from underneath the floor.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"underneath","gloss":"在下面","context":"Patients could hear footsteps overhead and feel moisture rising from underneath the floor.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Travelers arriving aboard a ferry rarely noticed the old castle above the terminal. Its tower had once defended a frontier, but the surrounding territory was now a busy metropolitan district. A glass skyscraper stood alongside the stone monument, and the avenue below led downtown to a former palace. The county museum wanted to explain how this changing setting connected trade, power, and ordinary movement. Rather than treat the past as a separate realm, it designed a walking tour that began where passengers actually arrived, in the midst of luggage, announcements, and people looking for the exit.","zh":"乘渡轮到达的旅客很少注意航站楼上方的古堡。城堡高塔曾守卫边疆，如今周边地域已成为繁忙的大都市地区。玻璃摩天楼与石质纪念建筑并立，下方的大道通向市中心昔日的宫殿。郡博物馆希望解释这种不断变化的环境如何连接贸易、权力与日常出行。它没有把过去当成独立世界，而是让徒步导览从旅客真正抵达的地方开始：行李、广播和寻找出口的人群之中。"},{"en":"The route crossed a yard and passed through a gate beside a flag pole. From there, visitors could look southeast toward the mainland or northeast across the harbor. A guide explained that ships had linked the province to distant markets long before modern highways existed. Altitude offered military advantage: from the outer wall, guards could observe the water and signal danger. Yet defense also shaped domestic life. People entering the castle crossed a threshold where their right to remain was examined. The architecture organized who could move inward, who had to wait, and who was sent away.","zh":"路线穿过庭院，经过旗杆旁的大门。人们可以向东南眺望大陆，也可以向东北望过港口。讲解员介绍，在现代公路出现很久以前，船只就把这个省与远方市场连接起来。高度带来军事优势：守卫在外墙上观察水面并发出警报。然而，防御也塑造内部生活。进入古堡的人跨过门槛时，留下的资格会受到检查。建筑决定谁能进入、谁必须等待、谁会被拒绝。"},{"en":"Inside, an underground corridor reached a storage chamber beneath the main hall. The interior was cool even amid summer heat. A small hole admitted daylight, while a separate outlet allowed smoke to escape. Visitors walked down an aisle between exhibits and learned that a former hospital ward had occupied part of the building. Its high dome created an impressive vertical space, but magnificence did not guarantee comfort. Patients could hear footsteps overhead and feel moisture rising from underneath the floor. Historical experience depended on one's circumstances, not simply on whether a building appeared grand from the street.","zh":"内部的一条地下走廊通往大厅下方的储藏室。即使盛夏，里面也很凉。一处小孔引入日光，另一个出口排走烟气。参观者沿展品之间的通道行走，得知这里的一部分曾是医院病房。高大的穹顶形成壮观的垂直空间，但宏伟并不等于舒适。病人听得见头顶脚步声，也感受得到从地板下面升起的湿气。历史中的生活体验取决于个人处境，而不是建筑从街上看起来是否气派。"},{"en":"A staircase led upward to a lookout and then downward into a restored workshop. One exhibit showed workers keeping heavy frames upright; another traced an old drain outward toward the river. The guide warned visitors not to step backward near the verge of an uneven landing. For children, these practical instructions made the site feel real. A fortress was not merely an image in a textbook: people had carried water, repaired doors, and struggled with poor light inside it. The tour avoided suggesting that every century moved smoothly toward progress. Some later changes improved life, while others destroyed useful local knowledge.","zh":"楼梯向上通往瞭望处，随后向下进入修复后的工坊。一件展品展示工人如何扶稳沉重框架，另一件说明旧排水沟怎样向外延伸至河流。讲解员提醒游客，不要在不平整平台的边缘向后退。对孩子来说，这些实用提醒让遗址变得真实。堡垒不只是课本里的图像：人们曾在里面搬水、修门，并克服昏暗的光线。导览也没有暗示每个世纪都平稳地走向进步。有些后来的变化改善生活，有些则破坏了有用的地方知识。"},{"en":"At the final stop, passengers could see the modern waterfront again. The castle's political domain had disappeared, but its walls still influenced roads and property lines. History was nowhere completely separate from contemporary life. It survived in a doorway, a path, or the decision to preserve a view. The museum hoped visitors would leave with a habit rather than a collection of dates: noticing how public space distributes access and authority. A terminal may seem to exist only for departure, yet it can also invite a community to reconsider where it has come from and what it wishes to keep.","zh":"在最后一站，旅客又看见现代滨水区。古堡的政治管辖范围早已消失，但城墙仍影响道路和地产边界。历史从未完全脱离当代生活。它存留在门口、路径或保护某处景观的决定里。博物馆希望人们带走一种习惯，而不仅是一串年代：留意公共空间如何分配使用机会与权力。航站楼看似只为离开而存在，却也能邀请社区回顾自身来路，思考想保留什么。"}],"previous":93,"next":95});
